{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_08_31_strategy_generation_rebuild_design", "label": "Strategy Generation Rebuild \u2014 Design", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-31-strategy-generation-rebuild-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The pipeline's problem is a representation problem, not a search problem: the harvester prompt maps every scraped idea to the nearest of eight families and fills unspecified genes with midpoints, so of 409 web-sourced ideas zero became a strategy."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_08_31_strategy_generation_rebuild_design_strategyspec", "label": "StrategySpec", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-31-strategy-generation-rebuild-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "One artifact with three consumers (Strategist writes, Analyst compiles and judges, Librarian prints) so there is no drift; data_requires is derived by the compiler so the LLM cannot misdeclare it, and exits live inside the spec instead of global config."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_08_31_strategy_generation_rebuild_design_dsl", "label": "Restricted strategy DSL", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-31-strategy-generation-rebuild-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "An allow-listed AST subset parsed with ast.parse(mode='eval') is strictly safer than exec()ing LLM-written Python behind a builtins whitelist, which does not stop __class__/__subclasses__ traversal."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_08_31_strategy_generation_rebuild_design_feature_library", "label": "Feature library / registry", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-31-strategy-generation-rebuild-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The registry IS the Strategist's vocabulary, so novelty scales with it; price features wrap agents/indicators.py and unit tests assert the Series' last value equals the existing scalar so the two judges never diverge."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_08_31_strategy_generation_rebuild_design_vector_backtester", "label": "Vectorized backtester", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-31-strategy-generation-rebuild-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Entries are sparse, so only candidate entry indices are iterated and exits resolved by bounded forward search \u2014 a ~76x speed target; the equivalence harness is mandatory because without trade-for-trade equality the cutover is faith-based."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_08_31_strategy_generation_rebuild_design_derivatives_layer", "label": "Derivatives and flow data layer", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-31-strategy-generation-rebuild-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The recorder ships in phase 1 even though consuming strategies arrive later: 30-day-window endpoints and liquidations cannot be backfilled, and history not recorded is permanently lost. Point-in-time alignment (funding shifted to settlement) is the correctness risk."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_08_31_strategy_generation_rebuild_design", "target": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_08_31_strategy_generation_rebuild_design_strategyspec", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-31-strategy-generation-rebuild-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_08_31_strategy_generation_rebuild_design", "target": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_08_31_strategy_generation_rebuild_design_dsl", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-31-strategy-generation-rebuild-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_08_31_strategy_generation_rebuild_design", "target": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_08_31_strategy_generation_rebuild_design_feature_library", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-31-strategy-generation-rebuild-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_08_31_strategy_generation_rebuild_design", "target": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_08_31_strategy_generation_rebuild_design_vector_backtester", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-31-strategy-generation-rebuild-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_08_31_strategy_generation_rebuild_design", "target": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_08_31_strategy_generation_rebuild_design_derivatives_layer", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-31-strategy-generation-rebuild-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_08_31_strategy_generation_rebuild_design_strategyspec", "target": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_08_31_strategy_generation_rebuild_design_dsl", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-31-strategy-generation-rebuild-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_specs_202